{
  "description": "使用 discover 返回的可用引擎生成音频文件。AI 对普通朗读优先选本机 engine:local；剧情、角色或情绪需要且所配置 API 支持时选 engine:remote，并按能力传 instructions/speed。省略 engine 仅选本机；prompt 只填台词，voice/format 取自对应引擎。返回 job.status 为 ready 时音频已生成，无需调用 job.status/wait；job.jobId 是媒体回执，不是通用作业引用。直接把 job.resources[].source 原样交给 media.insert/apply 或 artifact.save，不当作 compute 输入路径。失败不自动换引擎；所需表现能力不可用时如实说明，不把普通朗读当成已交付角色表演。",
  "inputSchema": {
    "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "durationSeconds": {
        "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
        "type": "number"
      },
      "engine": {
        "enum": [
          "local",
          "remote"
        ],
        "type": "string"
      },
      "format": {
        "enum": [
          "mp3",
          "wav"
        ],
        "type": "string"
      },
      "instructions": {
        "description": "仅声明支持该能力的语音 API 使用：情绪、语调、角色表演等要求，不是要朗读的台词。",
        "maxLength": 4096,
        "minLength": 1,
        "type": "string"
      },
      "kind": {
        "enum": [
          "speech",
          "video",
          "music"
        ],
        "type": "string"
      },
      "language": {
        "minLength": 1,
        "type": "string"
      },
      "prompt": {
        "description": "语音填写需要实际朗读的台词原文，不填写朗读指令；视频或音乐填写生成说明。",
        "minLength": 1,
        "type": "string"
      },
      "referenceResources": {
        "items": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "type": "string"
        },
        "type": "array"
      },
      "speed": {
        "maximum": 4,
        "minimum": 0.25,
        "type": "number"
      },
      "voice": {
        "maxLength": 200,
        "minLength": 1,
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    "required": [
      "kind",
      "prompt"
    ],
    "type": "object"
  },
  "invocation": "静态目录只说明已登记接口；当前运行是否可调用、文档范围、写权限、短句柄和服务配置，以宿主本轮发现与实际回执为准。",
  "manual": {
    "group": "edit",
    "label": "media.start",
    "targetKinds": []
  },
  "name": "media.start",
  "version": 1
}
